        "text_BXerUm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A honeybee colony is what’s known as a superorganism. Thousands of individual bees functioning as one unified body, with a collective consciousness.<br/><br/>The Apiarian Home's five fragrances are inspired by that intelligence. Each scent is drawn from a role and place within the colony. Like the hive itself, they are designed to collectively support your daily rhythms and rituals. Together, they form a holistic collection to bring the essence of nature into your home.</p>"
