    "image_with_text_apR36D": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_KbBUCd": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Step Inside the Colony",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_yyVPkD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A honeybee colony is what’s known as a superorganism. Thousands of individual bees functioning as one unified body, each one a cell in a breathing, thinking, feeling whole. They share resources, regulate temperature together, communicate through vibration and scent, and make collective decisions with a precision that rivals any brain. The consciousness belongs to the whole. No single bee holds it alone.<br/><br/>The Apiarian Home's five room fragrances are inspired by that intelligence. Each scent is drawn from a role within the colony, the Brood, Worker, Drone, and Queen. These are five distinct energies that are both whole on their own and complete together. Like the hive itself, they are designed to collectively support your daily rhythm. Together, they form a holistic collection to bring the essence of nature into your home.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
