    "rich_text_kRTFfe": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_iTDtyQ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "About the Formulas",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_nPepC9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Within all of these scents, beeswax is the constant ingredient.<strong><br/><br/></strong>Each blend starts with an alcohol base infused with raw beeswax, bringing in the wax’s natural esters and compounds.</p><p>One pound of beeswax requires honeybees to consume roughly eight pounds of honey, representing the energy gathered from more than 16 million flower visits. It's a precious ingredient, embodying one of the many ways that bees are the alchemists of nature.</p><p>Beeswax has been used by humans for a very long time. Face cream, medicines, tools, waterproofing, candles, and so much more. This is a different and immersive way to experience the wondrous substance.</p>"
          }
        },
