    "multirow_f9byNa": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_6LhdUh": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/discovery_set_on_beeswax.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "COLONY DISCOVERY SET",
            "text": "<p>You are standing at the entrance of a wondrous cave, holding a map to its winding, organic pathways. You don't have to choose a direction just yet; instead, you are invited to wander through the chambers at your own pace, letting your senses guide you through shadows and light. <em><strong>What happens when you stop trying to plan it all, and simply let yourself explore your surroundings?</strong></em></p>",
            "button_label": "Buy Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/the-colony-discovery-set"
          }
        },
        "row_Mtnhrz": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/hive_100ml_50ml.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "HIVE",
            "text": "<p><em>You are on your way to meet a friend for coffee and you see someone helping their neighbor with a task. The kindness makes you stop and smile as a bee briefly buzzes across your path. </em><em><strong>In what ways do you feel connected to your community?</strong></em></p>",
            "button_label": "Buy Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/hive-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "row_inBzz3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/brood_100ml_50ml.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "BROOD",
            "text": "<p><em>It is late in the evening. Honey cookies are baking in the oven and you are curled up with a good book. </em><em><strong>What in your life deserves care and nurturing?</strong></em></p>",
            "button_label": "Buy Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/brood-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "row_c6UjQV": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/worker_100ml_50ml.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "WORKER",
            "text": "<p><em>You are at the farmers market early, moving from stall to stall, filling your basket with goods that someone took care to grow. </em><em><strong>What are you gathering that feels purposeful in your life right now?</strong></em></p>",
            "button_label": "Buy Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/worker-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "row_HyyUPy": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/drone_100ml_50ml_d9f296db-ef86-425f-9a80-deb4e392bebb.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "DRONE",
            "text": "<p><em>You are deep in the woods when you round a bend and stop. There is a tree ahead, massive and ancient, with a low humming somewhere in the distance. It draws you in and you continue down the path. </em><em><strong>What are you ready to pursue without hesitation?</strong></em></p>",
            "button_label": "Buy Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/drone-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "row_4NF4Lt": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/queen_100ml_50ml.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "QUEEN",
            "text": "<p><em>The table is set, the bouquets are arranged, and the beeswax candles are lit. Every detail has been considered, every guest is expected, and the room hums with abundance. </em><em><strong>What in your life is ready to be celebrated?</strong></em></p>",
            "button_label": "Buy Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/queen-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "row_QUaDNQ": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/all_fragrances.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "GIFT CARD",
            "text": "<p><em>Your calendar dings with a special reminder. It is a busy day, but it makes you pause in gratitude.</em> <em><strong>What could be a small act of kindness toward yourself, or someone important in your life? </strong></em></p>",
            "button_label": "Buy Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/the-apiarian-home-gift-card"
          }
        }
      },
