    "multicolumn_emfMYn": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_xB3FFD": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_brood.jpg",
            "title": "BROOD",
            "text": "<p>The nurtured younglings. Chamomile, lavender, frankincense, gardenia, and benzoin, wrapped in beeswax. In the hive, nurse bees tend the brood around the clock, keeping the youngest bees warm and fed. This scent holds that same comfort.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/brood-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "column_i4LAqL": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_worker.jpg",
            "title": "WORKER",
            "text": "<p>The maiden foragers. Blood orange, grapefruit, coriander, rosemary, black pepper, labdanum, and lemongrass, grounded in beeswax. A forager bee may visit up to 5,000 flowers in a single day, carrying gifts of pollen and nectar back to the hive. This blend captures that vivid, purposeful energy.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/worker-fragrance"
          }
